      "name": "Daughter of the Sea",
      "index": 1,
      "summary": "A young mermaid trades her voice and her very nature for legs and a chance at human love, only to lose the prince to another and face a choice her heart cannot bring itself to make.",
      "isFavorite": false,
      "extraNotes": null,
      "createdAt": "2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
