      "name": "The Little Mermaid",
      "title": null,
      "gender": "Female",
      "race": "Mermaid",
      "subrace": null,
      "description": "The youngest of the Sea King's daughters, more dreamy and quiet than her sisters.",
      "personality": "Dreamy, quiet, and willing to endure great pain for a love she barely knows.",
      "motivation": "Longs for an immortal soul, which only a human's love can grant a mermaid.",
      "qualities": "Selfless to a fault, and graceful even in constant, silent pain on her new human legs.",
      "weaknesses": "Gives up her voice entirely to pursue the Prince, leaving her no way to explain who she truly is.",
      "biography": "The youngest daughter of the Sea King, who trades her voice to the Sea Witch for legs and a chance to win a prince's love.",
      "plannedTimeline": "Cannot bring herself to kill the Prince to save her own life, and dissolves into foam - only to rise again among the daughters of the air.",
      "isFavorite": false,
      "extraNotes": null,
