      "title": "King of the sea",
      "gender": "Male",
      "race": "Merman",
      "subrace": null,
      "description": "The widowed ruler of the undersea kingdom, proud father of six daughters.",
      "personality": "Dignified and protective, though distant in the way of a ruler with many duties.",
      "motivation": "Wants his daughters to be content within the sea kingdom, mermaid customs and all.",
      "qualities": "Respected throughout the undersea kingdom as a fair and steady ruler.",
      "weaknesses": "Has no power to stop his youngest daughter once she sets her heart on the world above the waves.",
      "biography": "The widowed ruler of the undersea kingdom, raising six mermaid daughters with the help of his own mother.",
      "plannedTimeline": "Remains in the Sea Kingdom throughout, aware only secondhand of his daughter's fate above the waves.",
      "isFavorite": false,
