      "id": "01KYXKY1XPKDZGG2NXPXPFF2BE",
      "storyId": "01KYXBHD0ME7CZXCJDMH2Q8586",
      "title": "The Price of the Potion",
      "body": "The Sea Witch demands the little mermaid's voice as payment - cutting out her tongue before handing over the potion. Voiceless, the little mermaid can win the Prince's affection only through her dancing and her eyes, never by telling him who she truly is.",
